flowchart TB
  U[Web / Mobile Clients] --> FE[Next.js / React Shell<br/>Role-aware Dashboard]
  FE --> GW[API Gateway<br/>TLS · routing · edge limits]
  GW --> ID[M0 Identity & Access]
  GW --> HR[M1 HR Management]
  GW --> PT[M2 Projects & Tasks]
  GW --> MT[M3 Meetings]
  GW --> AS[M4 Assets & Inventory]
  GW --> FI[M5 Finance]
  GW --> RA[M6 Reports & Analytics]
  GW --> AP[M7 Approvals]
  GW --> DO[M8 Documents]
  GW --> AI[M9 AI Assistant]
  GW --> NO[M10 Notifications]
  GW --> KB[M11 Company Knowledge Base]
  GW --> ST[M12 Settings]
  ID --> PG[(PostgreSQL<br/>service-owned schemas)]
  HR --> PG
  PT --> PG
  MT --> PG
  AS --> PG
  FI --> PG
  RA --> PG
  AP --> PG
  DO --> PG
  AI --> PG
  NO --> PG
  KB --> PG
  ST --> PG
  HR -. outbox/events .-> MQ[(RabbitMQ)]
  PT -. outbox/events .-> MQ
  MT -. outbox/events .-> MQ
  AS -. outbox/events .-> MQ
  FI -. outbox/events .-> MQ
  AP -. decisions .-> MQ
  DO -. lifecycle .-> MQ
  MQ -. consumers .-> NO
  MQ -. projections .-> RA
  MQ -. indexing .-> KB
  MQ -. tool/audit events .-> AI
  DO --> OBJ[(Object Storage)]
  RA --> OBJ
  ID -. bounded cache / rate limit .-> REDIS[(Redis)]
  OBS[Logs · Metrics · Traces · Alerts] --- GW
  OBS --- ID
  OBS --- HR
  OBS --- PT
  OBS --- MT
  OBS --- AS
  OBS --- FI
  OBS --- RA
  OBS --- AP
  OBS --- DO
  OBS --- AI
  OBS --- NO
  OBS --- KB
  OBS --- ST
